    "@id": "https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ctlo#constantPartOf",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "Borrowed from DOLCE ontology as: \"ConstantPartOf is the constant version of Temporary Parthood which is a ternary relation between two endurants x, y and a time interval t. The intended interpretation is that the endurant x is a part of the endurant y over the time interval t. In this constant version, the endurant x is part of the endurant y during the whole existence of y.\""
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
